{"data":{"body":"**P2:** This queues the child's timeout and first invocation but does not make that invocation survive shutdown. Once `_child_starts_in_flight` drops, `shutdown()` closes the invocation pool, so queued work can be canceled or its result discarded, leaving the persisted child and parent operation STARTED. Make launch durably recoverable before releasing the in-flight count, and test persisted child/parent state after a real scheduler shutdown rather than scheduler call counts.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7wg2vl","finding_digest":"933c833314bdacb3bbc23d78a07b7e1ef9a679c4205bb5a94755649e903288c8","finding_id":"arf_v1_sm6igmyuxwwlho6chv4ka636d3","finding_key":"testing/executor.py::shutdown::running-pool-work-survives","identity_key":"testing/executor.py::shutdown::running-pool-work-survives","line":2312,"observation_digest":"1ad8b8f5d6fb168b5ee59ad37fa02ab84956973378fba8346c5ba3823d5cfbdb","observation_id":"aro_v1_dlmlr5ow7mliwxxftljx7ibkxb","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/executor.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_sm6igmyuxwwlho6chv4ka636d3","published_at":"2026-09-17T09:20:38Z","review_id":"arr_v1_6fgbuaf6kfgym33jkdawdtz66x","reviewed_base_sha":"cf4d27f59c2bf14f87c3ef75f58fc0881b2e2c34","reviewed_head_sha":"016ccb33c00e7b8840da85de747444f9ec131aec","reviewer":"codex","start_line":2312,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_y75mzff5qa3wnjk44e2oycst3s","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-17T09:20:38Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
